<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Galatiate</book>
  <para style="h">Galatiate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatiate</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiate</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatiate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte kung pan hi ngawl, mihingte ii piansak thu zongh hi ngawl, thina pan Jesus a tho kiksak Pa Pathian le Jesus Christ kung pan sapna a nga sawltak ahi keima Paul ii tung pan laithak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi sungah a om suapuite theampo in Galatia ngam pawlpite tungah kimuana kam kong thaak khawm uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu a hunpha ngawl sia panin ih suatak natu in ih Pa Pathian ii deina a zuina taw, Christ in eite ii mawna hangin ama le ama hong kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian tungah minthanna a tawntung a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note lamdang kong sa hi! Christ ii thuthiamna taw note hong sam pa, tawmvei no sungin na taisan uh a, tuaciang lungdamna thu a dang khat na saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tatakin, “lungdamna thu a dang” om tuan ngawl hi, ahihang hi bang a kong ci theina in mihing pawlkhat in Christ ii lungdamna thu laih tu in hanciam uh a, na thin uh hong nawngkaisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang kote ka hi uh zong, ahibuale vantunglalang khat keak ahihialzong, note tungah kong hil sa lungdamna thu taw a kitumdangin hong hil a om le tua mi sia hell khuk sungah kivawk tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu masia zonghin kong ci zo uh hi, tu zonghin kong ci kik hi. Khat po in na saansa uh lungdamna thu sia taw a kitumdang khat hong hil le tua pa sia hell khuk sungah kivawk tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bang a ka awsua sia mihingte ii diksak tu hi na sa uh ziam? Hi ngawl het hi! Pathian ii diksak tu bek ka deina hi! Mihingte maipha nga nuamin a hanciam ka hi ziam? Tuabangin hanciam lai ka hile Christ ii naseam khat ka hi buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, ka hil lungdamna thu in mihing tung pan a piang thu hi ngawl hi ci sia kong son nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo tung panin ka nga hi ngawl hi, kuama ii hong hil zongh ahi bua hi. Kei tungah hong pualaak sia Jesus Christ ama mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jew te biakna sungah ka kipiak laitakin, kei sia bangbangin a nungta mi hi a, bangbangin Pathian ii pawlpi hesuakna nei ngawlin vawtsia a, a siasak tu in ka hi thei za in hanciam khi ziam, ci teng sia no tung ah hong kisonsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jew te biakna ka zui sung teng in ka khanngualte a tamzaw mai ah ka madawk a, ih pute ii taangh ngeinate sungah amate sangin a nasia zawin a kipia pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang, Pathian in ka pian ma ngawngawnin a thuthiamna taw hong teal a, ama ii na a seam tu in hong sam hi. Ama ii a khensat hun hong cing a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gentile te tungah ama huvau Lungdamna Thupha ka hil thei natu in a Tapa kei tungah hong pualaak ciang, ngaisutna pha ngenin kuama kungah ka pai bua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kei mai a, sawltak a seamte taw kimu tu zonghin Jerusalem ah ka pai bua hi. Tua taangin, Arabia ah thakhatin ka pai a, tua zawkciang Damascus ah ka heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawk kum thum ciangin Peter tung pan thu za tu in Jerusalem ah ka pai a, nipi nii sung, ama kungah ka taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa ii suapuipa James simngawl sawltak dangte ka mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kong at teng thumaan hi. Leilot ngawl ka hi sia Pathian in hong he hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Syria le Cilicia ngamsung mun tuatuam ah ka pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Judea pawlpite sungah a om pawlpi mite in kei hong he tatak bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Midangte ii hi bang a, a pau teng bekma a he uh hi: “Eite hong vawtsia ngei mipa in khatvei lai a lalsak tu in a hanciamh upna sia, tu in thuhilna in nei hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuabangin amate in kei hu in Pathian pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawm le kum li zawkciang Barnabas taw Jerusalem ah ka cia kik uh a, Titus sia keima in ka tonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in ka pai natu hong pualaak ahikom ka pai hi. Lampuite taw ka kimu tuamna sungah, Gentile te tung ka hil lungdamna thu teng ka sonthiang hi. A bosa hun ahizong, tu laitak ahizong, ka nasepna sungah lelna ka thuak tu ka uuk bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kitholpuipa Titus sia Greek mi ahitazong zawthawk thu taw a vunteap ki atsak ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahizong mihing pawlkhat in vunteap atsak nuam hi. Christ Jesus taw ih kipumkhatna tungtawnin ih nga suatakna thu kan nuamin, hi mite pawlkhat sia ih thu uppuite bangin hong kivawt a, eite sungah thudawpku tu in hong tum ku hi. Amate in eite sila in hong kai nuam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahihang lungdamna thu ii thumaanna sia note atu a kikepcing thei natu in, amate deina tawmvei bek zongh ih zawp hun a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong lampui tu bang ahi tuate — amate bang po ahizong kei atu a lamdan ngawlna taw hi bangin ka pau ahi hi; Pathian in a puasang pianzia te taw thukhen ngawl hi — tua lampui te in kei tungah ngaisutna thak piakna bangma hong nei ngawl hi ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jew te tungah lungdamna thu hil tu nasep sia Peter tungah a piak bangin Pathian in kei sia Gentile te tungah lungdamna thu hil tu in nasep hong piak sia amate ii a musa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ii vaangletna taw kei sia Gentile te atu in sawltak ka hi a, Peter sia Jew te atu in sawltak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lampui ahi tuak James, Peter le John te in Pathian ii hi nasep tuam hong piakna hong heakpui hi; tua ahikom amate in Barnabas le kei hong nukset a, tuasia in ei teng maapang khawm tek tu ci in limlakna ahi hi. Barnabas le kei sia Gentile te sungah seam tu a, amate sia Jew te sungah seam tu in ka thukim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate hong nget thu khat sia amate pawl sungah, a cimawte ka phaw pui natu hi a, tua thu in sep tu ka lawp thu tatak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Antioch ah Peter hong pai ciangin, mihon mai ah ama ka nalh hi, banghang ziam cile ama in khial citak ma in khial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />James ii hong puak mihing pawlkhat tua mun a thet ma in, Peter sia Gentile suapuite taw an nekhawm zo hi. Ahihang hi mite hong thet zawkciang, vunteap a atsak nuamte a kiitak hu in, ama kikeam a, Gentile te taw an a nekhawm nuam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jew suapui dangte zongh Peter bangma in a lauthauh te bang hong hi paih hi; tuaciang Barnabas ngawngawn zongh amate lauthauh ngamtatna in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungdamna thu thumaan lampi tang sia, amate in tawn ngawl hi, ci in ka mu ciangin, Peter munah amate theampo mai ah hi bangin ka ci hi. “Nang sia Jew mi khat hi napi Gentile te bangin a nungta nginge sa na hi a, Jew te bangin na nungta bua hi. Tua ahiciang Gentile te sia Jew te bangin a nuntak natu in bangbangin zawthawk thu taw na sawl zo tu ziam,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tatakin eite sia ih pian panin Jew te ih hi hi, “Gentile mawneite” a kici te ih hi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong mihing khat sia Jesus Christ ih upna tung bek tawnin, Pathian mai ah thutang kisuaksak hi ci in ih he a, Thukham ii deina bang sepna taw hi ngeingawl hi. Eite zongh in Thukham ii deina bang ih sepna taw hi ngawlin, Christ ih upna tungtawnin Pathian mai ah thutang ih sua natu in, Christ Jesus ih um zo hi. Banghang ziam cile Thukham ii deina zuina taw Pathian mai ah kuama thutang kisuaksak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahile Christ taw ih kipumkhatna pan thutang suak tu in, ih hanciam tak ciang, Gentile te za ma in mimawte in hong kimu ahile Christ sia mawna a piangsak tu in a seam ahi tu ziam? Hi ngawl het hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thukham ka phiat sate puuapha kik tu in, ka kipan le — Thukham a paltan khat ka hi hunlam keima le keima a kipualaak ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Thukham taw kisai in kei ka thi zo hi — Thukham mama in hong thatlum zo hi — Pathian atu ka nuntak thei natu ahi hi. Christ taw ama ii thinglamtee tungah ka thi khawm zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tua ahikom, a nungta sia kei ka hi nawn bua a, ahihang kei sungah a nungta sia Christ ahi hi. Tu a ka nuntakna sia ahile kei hong it a, a nuntakna kei atu hong pia Pathian Tapa ka upna taw a nungta ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna nial tu ka uuk bua hi. Ahihang mihing khat in Thukham tungtawnin Pathian mai ah thutang kisuaksak ahile Christ ii thina in khiakna nei ngawl a suak hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Galatia mihing mawmawte awng! Akua in hong bum ziam? Jesus Christ ii thinglamtee tungah a thina thu sia na mittang uh taw, thiang takin na mu thei tu in hong kilak zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi thu khat sia hong son tavun: Pathian Thaa sia Thukham ii deina, na zuina uh panin, saang nu ziam maw, lungdamna thu za a, na upna uh pan nga hizaw nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangbangin tu zata in mawmaw thei nu ziam! Pathian Thaa taw kipan phot nu hi; tu in noma thahatna taw khup sawm nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na heaksa theampo no atu in bangma mama hi ngawl ahi ziam? Tawm peuma khiakna nei nanak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in Thaa hong pia a note sungah nalamdang lakna hong vawt sia Thukham ii deina na zui uh hang ziam maw lungdamna thu za a na up uh hang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham tungah thupiangte ngaisun vun; laithiangtho in, “Ama in Pathian um a, ama upna hangin Pathian in thumaan thutang in saang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Abraham suan tatakte sia upna a nei mihingte ahi hi, ci in na tel natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in Gentile te sia upna tungtawnin thutang suaksak tu hi ci in laithiangtho in sonkhol hi. Tua ahikom laithiangtho in Lungdamna Thupha sia Abraham tungah, “Nang tungtawnin Pathian in mihing nam theampo thupha pia tu hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham in um a thupha kipia hi; tua ahikom a umte theampo ama bangin thupha kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thukham zuina a suangte sia haamsiatna nuai ah nungta hi. Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “A kuama po Thukham laibu sungah a ki at teng a vekpi in a zui tawntung ngawlte sia Pathian ii haamsiatna nuai ah om hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in Thukham taw Pathian mai ah kuama thutang kisuaksak ngawl ci sia kitel thiang hi, banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Upna tungtawnin Pathian mai ah thutang a kisuaksak sia bek nungta tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Thukham in, upna taw a kisaina bangma om ngawl hi. “A kuama po thukham deina a vekpi in a seam peuma nungta tu hi,” laithiangtho in ci zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Christ in ei atu a kihaamsiatna taw Thukham ii hong puak haamsiatna panin eite ama in hong tan zo hi! Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “A kuama po, thing tungah a kikhai sia in Pathian ii haamsiatna nuai ah om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upna tungtawnin Pathian ii hong kamciamsa Thaa ih nga natu le Abraham tungah Pathian kamciamsa thuphate, Christ Jesus tungtawnin Gentile te tungah a kipiak thei natu in, Christ in tuabangin vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, ni sim a piang sonteena khat kong zangh tu hi: mihing nii in na khat tungtaang ah thukim in lungkimna lai a vawt uh le kuama in tua thukimna paltan thei ngawl a, belap thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in, Pathian in Abraham le ama ii suan pa tungah kamciamte pia hi. Laithiangtho in mihing a tam cina a lak “a suan a paalte” ci kammal zangh ngawlin, mihing khat bek a cinopna “a suan” ci kammal sia Christ a cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka son nop sia Pathian in Abraham taw thuciamna vawt a, ka kholet tu hi, ci in kamciam pia hi. Kum zali le kum sawmthum zawkciang a kipia Thukham in tua thuciamna paltan in Pathian kamciam sia phiat thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian letsong sia Thukham tungah kibulphu hile, ama kamciam tungah kibulphu ahi nawn bua hi. Ahizong ama ii kamciam hangin Pathian in Abraham sia tua letsong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile Thukham ii tupna in bang ziam? Tatkhialna sia bang ziam ci in a lak tu in a kibelap ahi hi, tuaciang tua Thukham sia kamciam a kipiakna pa, Abraham ii suan sia hong pian mateng a kho tu in a kingaisun ahi hi. Thukham sia vantunglalangte in hong thaaksuk a, mihing khat in a kilaklaw ah palai hong seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang mihing khat nguak sepna sungah palai kul ngawl hi; tuaciang Pathian sia khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahile Thukham sia Pathian kamciamte taw a kileebul ziam? Kileebul ngawl het hi! Banghang ziam cile mihingte in nuntakna hong pia thei Thukham khat a saang zo le tua thukham zuina taw mihing sim in Pathian mai ah thutang kisuaksak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang laithiangtho in leitung bup sia mawna vaangletna nuai ah om hi, ci hi; tua ahikom Jesus Christ ih upna bulphu a, a kipia kamciam sia, ama a umte tungah kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang upna nei natu hun hong thet ma in Thukham in hi hong pai tu upna hong kipualaak mateng eite theampo thongtaak bangin hong khabil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciangin Upna tungtawnin Pathian mai ah thutang ih sua thei natu in, Thukham in Christ ii hong pai mateng hong uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu in upna nei natu hun sia hisung hong theng zo ahikom, Thukham in eite hong uk nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note theampo sia upna tungtawnin Christ Jesus taw na kipumkhatna uh hu in Pathian ii tate na suak siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note Christ taw na kipumkhatna sungah na ki baptize uh a, tuaciang Christ ama mama ii nuntakna taw puan bangin hong kisilhsak zo cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jew te le Gentile te, silate le sila ahi ngawlte, pate le numeite kilaklaw tek ah kilamdanna om nawn ngawl hi; Christ Jesus taw na kipumkhat uh ciangin note theampo sia pumkhat na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Christ ii neisa na hi uh le, Abraham suante na hi uh a, Pathian hong kamciam sate na saang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihang tu in zomto suak leang — Pa ii ngamh a lua tu tapa in na theampo ama ii neisa ahihang, a khanmoi lai in sila bangin kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a khanmoi laitakin a pa ii a hun ciam dong a vai teng a hawmsak tu le ama a en tu in pasal pawlkhat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in eite zongh thaa lamsang ah ih khanthin matengin vaannuai bup a uk thaa te ii sila in ih om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang a hun hong cin pepeet ciang, Pathian in a Tapa hong paisak hi. Ama sia mihing ahi leitung nu khat ii tapa bangin hong pai a, Jew te Thukham nuai ah nungta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ii tapate tanute ih sua natu in thukham khutnuai ah a omte a tat natu in tuabangin hong piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note sia ama ii tapa tanute na hina uh a lak natu in, Pathian in a Tapa ii Thaa “Pa awng, Ka Pa awng!” ci in a au Thaa sia ih thin sungah hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom nang sila hi nawn ngawlin tapa khat na hi hi. Tuaciangin ama tapa hi zo na hikom, Pathian in a tapate a tanute atu, a nei theampo nangma hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hun bosa sungah note in Pathian na he bua uh hi, tua hu in a maan ngawl pathiante ii sila in na om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang tu in Pathian na heak zawk uh ciang — tua ahibuale Pathian ii no hong heak zawkciang ci leang — banghangin tua a zawngkhal, a khuangai huai ukna nei thaate kung zuan kik thei nu ziam? Banghangin amate sila suak kik nuam nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nite, thate, khuahunte le kumte na thupi laak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No huvau in ka thinngim hi! No atu ka sep sa teng bangma a kimang thei ngawl a suak bua natu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, hong ngen khi hi, keima bang hong hi tavun. Ahi tatakin ci leang kei zongh noma bangma ka hi hi. Kei tungah no ii nong khialna uh bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungdamna thu note kong hil maksakna ahang sia na he lai uh hi; ka ciinat hu a hong hil ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pumpi omzia sia note atu in thinngimpi khat ahitazong, nong zawngsak bua uh a nong nial bua uh hi. Vantunglalang khat na saan tu uh bangin nong saang zaw uh hi; Christ Jesus na saan tu uh bangin, kei nong saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualai in lungdam mama nu hi! Ahitazong bang teng piang man ziam? Na mittang uh khelkeak in kei hong pia thei le uhte hong pia nuam liangin om nu hi, ci in keima tatak ma in ka son thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahile, tu in thumaan thutak sia kong son hu in na ngalpa suak zo ka hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua midangte in note nasia takin hong thinnuammaw hi, ahihang amate tupna le sawmnate pha ngawl hi. Amate ii no hong kin bangin no zongh amate na kin thei natu in, no le kei hong khen nuam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in tuabang a kithin nopmawkna tatakte sia tupna le sawmna pha hithong le — hisia in note taw kong omkhop ciang bek hi ngawlin, a tawntung atu in pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka it tanote awng, Christ pianzia note sungah hong pian mateng in, numeite nausuak tu a tut ciangin a bot bangma in ka thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu laitakin note taw kong omkhawm thei nuam hi, tua hile kong ngaisut zia kikheal thei tu hi. Note atu in ka thinngim mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thukham khutnuai ah a om nuamte, thu khat kong dongh tu hi. Thukham ii cina sia za ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abraham in tapa nii nei a, khat sia sila numei taw a hin hi a, a dang khat sia sila ahi ngawl a suakta numei taw a hin ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sila numei taw a hin tapa sia mihing pian ngei bang a, piang hi. Ahihang a suakta numei taw a hin sia in Pathian kamciamna pan piang hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi te sia limlakna khat bangin kihe thei hi. Numei nii sia thuciamna nam nii hi. Sila in a piang tate a hing sia Hagar hi, tuaciang ama in Sinai mual ah a kivawt thuciamna ii lim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hagar sia Arabia ngam Sinai Mual ii lim hi a, a mihingte theampo taw sila kaai in a om lai hun Jerusalem khuapi ii lim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang vantung Jerusalem sia a suakta hi a, ama sia eite ii nu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Tasel numei awng, lungdam in! lungdamna taw aukeak in! Nang nautut nat a he ngeingawl nu awng! Banghang ziam cile, a kitaisan numei in, a pasal ii a nusiat ngeingawl numei sia sangin, ta tam a nei zaw tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isaac sia kamciamna panin piang ahi bangma tu in no, ka suapuite awng, kamciamna pan a piang tate na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hunlai in a pian ngei bangin a piang tapa in Pathian Thaa taw a piang tapa sia vawtsia hi; tu in zongh tuabang ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang laithiangtho in bang na ci ziam? “Sila numei le a tapa paikhiasak vun; banghang ziam cile sila numei ii tapa in a suakta numei ii tapa taw a pa lamhsa a lua khawm buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka suapuite awng, eite sia sila numei ii tate ih hi bua a, a suakta numei ii tate ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suatakna sia ei neisa hi — Christ in hong suaktasak zo hi! Tua ahikom a suakta mihingte bangin, ding vun a, sila na suak kik nuam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai vun! Keima Paul in kong ci hi, na vunteap uh na atsak nuam uh le Christ in note atu kimanna nei ngawl het ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khatvei ma kong ci kik hi, pasal khat peuma in a vunteap a atsak nuam le Thukham buppi a zui kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thukham zuina taw Pathian mai ah thutang sua natu na hanciam uh le no teng in noma le noma Christ kung pan a kikhaktan na hi uh hi. Note in Pathian ii thuthiamna puasia ah na om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote ka hi uh le ka lam etna uh sia Pathian in thutang hong suasak tu ci thu ahi hi; hi thusia ka upna uh tungtawnin Pathian ii Thaa vaangletna taw hong seam tu hi ci in ka ngak uh sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ Jesus taw pumkhatin ka om uh ciang vunteap atna ahizong, at ngawlna ahizong bangma kitumdanna a omsak bua hi; a thupi sia in ki itna tungtawn a, na a seam upna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na vawt uh sia pha mama hi! Akua in thumaan thu na nit tu sia hong khaktan ziam? Bangbangin ama in hong kaizawn ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No hong sam Pathian in tuabangin hong vawt ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A kithau sa anvui a khan natu in tol tawm bek kisamh hi,” a ci uh bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang note huvau in thinmuanna ka nei lai hi. Topa taw pum khatin ih nuntakna in, ngaisutna tumdang na nei ngawl natu in hong lungmuangsak a, hong nawngkaisak pa sia akua po ahizong, Pathian in daan pia tu hi, ci in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang kei ka hile, ka suapuite awng, vunteap at kul hi ci in thu hil lai ka hile banghangin hong kivawtsia lai ziam? Tua sia in thumaan hi thongle Christ ii thinglamtee thu ka hilna in bangma ngimna a piangsak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No hong nawngkaisak mite tai siat le ka oai hi; amate le amate cil kinget vet tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, no sia a suakta tu in hong kisam hi. Ahihang hi suatakna in chi le sa deina ii hong ukna tu a paulap nuam hisak heak vun. Tua taangin ki itna taw khat le khat kihu vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Thukham buppi sia thupiak khat in kingawm hi: “Nangma le nangma na ki it bangin na innpaamte na it in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang ngamsate bangin na ngamta uh a, khat le khat kisuu in na kiliamsak uh le, tuasia ciang kidawm tavun, tua ahibuale khat le khat kilalcipsak tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kong son thu in hi sia ahi hi: Thaa in na nuntakna uh zeaksak vun, tua hile mihing pianzia ii deinate na lungkimsak buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ih mihing pianzia ii deite sia Thaa ii deite taw kilangpan hi, tuaciangin Thaa ii deite sia mihing pianzia ii deite taw kilangpan hi. Hite nii in kingal hi, na ngamtat nop uh bangin na ngamta thei bua uh hi a cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thaa in hong lampui le Thukham khutnuai ah na om nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing pianzia ii sepna sia thiang takin kimu hi. Tua sia in nu le pa paktatna, a kiihuai le zummawk ngamtatnate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milim biakna le bum le ai toaina te hi. Mihingte khat le khat kingalin kido uh hi; amate ki eangin, thin uukin, ultup uh hi. Amate a pawl a pawlin kikhen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kidungawkna, zukhamna, sikvil loklenna le hite taw a kibang ngamtatna dangte nei uh hi. Kidop natu kong piak ngei bangin tu in kong ci hi: hi bang ngamtatna neite in Pathian Ngam lua ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Thaa in itna, lungdamna, thinnopna, thinsauna, dikna, phatna, thumaanna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kiniam khiakna le eima le eima ki uk zawknate piangsak hi. Hi te a langpan thukham bangma a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciang Christ Jesus ii neisa ahite in, a mihing pianzia le tua ii uukna le deinate sia thi khawmsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thaa in nuntakna ei hong pia zo hi; ama in ih nuntakna zongh hong uk nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ei sia khat le khat tungah kiphasakin, kitaw in, ih ki eang buatu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, tatkhialna nam khat po taw mihing khat a kiman le, thaa taw a nungta note in, ama sia a dinmun maan ah na koi vun; ahihang cikna thiamna na zangh hamtang vun. Tuaciangin note zongh ze etna na thuak ngawl natu noma le noma ki en in kidawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khat le khat vanhngitte na kidawn tavun, tuabangin Christ ii thukham na zui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khat po in ama sia bangma hi ngawl napi, hi a kisa le ama le ama kitheam hi bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing khat simin ama le ama a ngamtatna kisit hen. A pha in a ngamta khat in ngualdang khat ii ngamtatna taw kiteengat ngawlin, ama ii ngamtat phatna tungah kisuangtaak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing sim in a vanh uh tek a puak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tapidaw thu a kihil pasal khat in, ama ii neisa na pha theampo a Syapa taw hawm tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noma le noma kitheam heak vun; Pathian sia kuama ii theam zawk hi ngawl hi. Mihing khat in a poai bang lianin a at tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in leitung pumpi deina lo sungah a poai le, tua mun panin thina an kaikhawm tu hi; Thaa ii deina lo sungah a poai le Thaa panin tawntung nuntakna an kaikhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom na pha sepna sungah toi kisa bua tawng; banghang ziam cile thinkiam in tawp bua po leang ih anlaak tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom hunpha ih nga simin mihing theampo tungah a pha ih seam tu a, a tuan in upna sung a ih innkuanpuite tungah ih seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima khut taw laithak kong at ciang, laimal lian taw ka at sia mu tu nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note tungah zawthawk thu taw vunteap hong atsak nuamte sia, a puatham thute ah kisa thei a, a kisuangtaakte ahi hi. Ahizong amate ii tuabang a vawtna sia, Jesus ii Thinglamtee hu in amate in vawtsiatna a thuak bua thei tha le ci in a ngaisut uh hang bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vunteap at te ngawngawn zongh Thukham a zui bua uh hi; note vunteap hong atsak nopna thu in, pumpi tung a zeksa vawtna sungah na tum uh sia, a kisuantaak thei natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong kei ka hile ih Topa Jesus Christ ii thinglamtee bekma ka kiphatsak pui tu hi; banghang ziam cile ama ii thinglamtee hangin leitung sia kei atu in a thisa hi a, keima in leitung atu in a thisa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing khat vunteap a ki at le a ki at ngawl sia a phatmawkna mama om ngawl het hi; a pha maw sia in mihing thak suana ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nuntakna sungah hi ngeina a zuite tungah thinnopna le hesuakna om tahen a — amate le Pathian mihing theampo tung zongh ah om tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu khupna ah: kuama in kei tungah ngimna hong pia thuasak nawn heak vun, banghang ziam cile ka pumpi tung a meima pawn omte in kei sia Jesus ii sila ka hina lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, ih Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna sia note theampo tungah hong om tahen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
